      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think it might add well here that I've seen similar issue from avatars that have movement sound. Like for example this Lego Droid I have seen. Locally you can hear it has sound for rolling, but it doesn't play for anyone else.",
      "viewerReactions": null
